        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;\nflowchart TD\n    Start([Start]) --&gt; Login[User Login]\n    Login --&gt; AuthCheck{Valid Credentials?}\n    AuthCheck -- No --&gt; LoginFail[Show Error] --&gt; Login\n    AuthCheck -- Yes --&gt; RoleCheck{Determine Role}\n\n    %% Admin Flow\n    RoleCheck -- Admin --&gt; AdminDash[Admin Dashboard]\n    AdminDash --&gt; AdminAction{Select Action}\n    AdminAction -- Manage Master Data --&gt; MasterData[Employee/Dept/Designation/Shift/Holiday CRUD]\n    AdminAction -- Manage Users --&gt; UserMgmt[User &amp; Role Management]\n    AdminAction -- Configure Payroll Rules --&gt; PayrollConfig[Salary/Tax/PF/Loan Rules]\n    AdminAction -- View Reports --&gt; AdminReports[System-wide Reports]\n    MasterData --&gt; AuditLog1[System: Log Audit Event]\n    UserMgmt --&gt; AuditLog1\n    PayrollConfig --&gt; AuditLog1\n    AuditLog1 --&gt; AdminDash\n\n    %% HR Flow\n    RoleCheck -- HR --&gt; HRDash[HR Dashboard]\n    HRDash --&gt; HRAction{Select Action}\n    HRAction -- Review Attendance --&gt; AttReview[Review/Correct Attendance]\n    HRAction -- Review Leave --&gt; LeaveReview{Approve or Reject Leave?}\n    HRAction -- Review Overtime --&gt; OTReview{Approve or Reject OT?}\n    HRAction -- Onboard Employee --&gt; Onboard[Create Draft Employee Profile]\n    HRAction -- Request Payroll Run --&gt; PayrollRequest[Trigger Payroll Cycle]\n\n    LeaveReview -- Approve --&gt; LeaveApproved[System: Update Leave Balance]\n    LeaveReview -- Reject --&gt; LeaveRejected[System: Notify Employee]\n    OTReview -- Approve --&gt; OTApproved[System: Mark OT Payroll-Eligible]\n    OTReview -- Reject --&gt; OTRejected[System: Notify Employee]\n    AttReview --&gt; AuditLog2[System: Log Audit Event]\n    LeaveApproved --&gt; AuditLog2\n    LeaveRejected --&gt; AuditLog2\n    OTApproved --&gt; AuditLog2\n    OTRejected --&gt; AuditLog2\n    Onboard --&gt; NotifyAdmin[Notify Admin to Activate Account]\n    PayrollRequest --&gt; SystemEngine\n\n    %% System Automation Flow\n    SystemEngine[[System: Payroll Engine Triggered]] --&gt; LockData[Lock Attendance/Leave Data]\n    LockData --&gt; CalcHours[Calculate Working Hours/Late/OT]\n    CalcHours --&gt; CalcLeave[Calculate Leave Balance Impact]\n    CalcLeave --&gt; CalcGross[Calculate Gross Salary]\n    CalcGross --&gt; CalcDeductions[Calculate Tax/PF/Loan/Bonus]\n    CalcDeductions --&gt; CalcNet[Calculate Net Salary]\n    CalcNet --&gt; GenerateBatch[Generate Payroll Batch]\n    GenerateBatch --&gt; NotifyAccountant[Notify Accountant: Batch Ready]\n\n    %% Accountant Flow\n    RoleCheck -- Accountant --&gt; AcctDash[Accountant Dashboard]\n    NotifyAccountant --&gt; AcctDash\n    AcctDash --&gt; VerifyBatch[Verify Payroll Batch]\n    VerifyBatch --&gt; ApprovalDecision{Approve Batch?}\n    ApprovalDecision -- Reject --&gt; RejectBatch[Return Batch with Remarks]\n    RejectBatch --&gt; NotifyHR[Notify HR/Admin of Rejection]\n    NotifyHR --&gt; HRDash\n    ApprovalDecision -- Approve --&gt; ApproveBatch[System: Mark Batch Approved]\n    ApproveBatch --&gt; GenBankFile[Generate Bank Transfer File]\n    GenBankFile --&gt; ProcessPayment[Process Payment via Bank]\n    ProcessPayment --&gt; ConfirmPaid[Mark Batch as Paid]\n    ConfirmPaid --&gt; GenPayslip[System: Generate Payslip PDFs]\n    GenPayslip --&gt; SendNotify[System: Send Payslip Notifications]\n    SendNotify --&gt; UpdateDash[System: Update All Dashboards]\n    UpdateDash --&gt; AuditLog3[System: Log Audit Event]\n\n    %% Employee Flow\n    RoleCheck -- Employee --&gt; EmpDash[Employee Dashboard]\n    EmpDash --&gt; EmpAction{Select Action}\n    EmpAction -- Check In/Out --&gt; CheckInOut[Record Attendance]\n    EmpAction -- Apply Leave --&gt; ApplyLeave[Submit Leave Request]\n    EmpAction -- View Payslip --&gt; ViewPayslip[Download Payslip PDF]\n    CheckInOut --&gt; AuditLog4[System: Log Audit Event]\n    ApplyLeave --&gt; LeaveReview\n    ViewPayslip --&gt; AuditLog4\n    SendNotify --&gt; EmpDash\n\n    AuditLog2 --&gt; HRDash\n    AuditLog3 --&gt; AcctDash\n    AuditLog4 --&gt; EmpDash\n\n    %% Logout\n    AdminDash --&gt; Logout{Logout?}\n    HRDash --&gt; Logout\n    AcctDash --&gt; Logout\n    EmpDash --&gt; Logout\n    Logout -- Yes --&gt; End([End])\n    Logout -- No --&gt; RoleCheck\n```&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="T7wnpdir9DjRqf9DZpOT-1">
